{"stories":{"ep5/npcpanel_menu_10008870":{"episode":"ep5","category":"npcpanel_menu","story_id":"10008870","sequence_index":102,"plot_row_index":"6542","order_index":"6542","numeric_id":"10008870","physical_section":"ep5","plot_id":"10008870","dialogue_kind":"Menu","metadata_source":"story_metadata_generated_context","metadata_sources":["story_metadata_context"],"summary":"","context_summary_source_cn":"金鳞蛇皇只是在活祭中被狩猎神改变了外貌的普通鱼类，并不会危害营地。但烈声和坚锤还是不放心，决定继续捕捉它。或许在某个夜晚的沼泽边，你还可以见到它的身影。","context_summary_i18n":{"cn":"金鳞蛇皇只是在活祭中被狩猎神改变了外貌的普通鱼类，并不会危害营地。但烈声和坚锤还是不放心，决定继续捕捉它。或许在某个夜晚的沼泽边，你还可以见到它的身影。","en":"The Gilded Serpent is just a fish, altered by the Hunting Goddess during a sacrifice, and poses no threat to Mirehold. But Luvo and Hardhammer remain doubtful and still plan to capture it. Maybe one night, you'll glimpse it by the swamp again.","jp":"ゴールデンサーペントは、狩猟神によって姿を変えられたただの魚に過ぎず、拠点を脅かす存在ではなかった。それでもシャウラとハイハンは警戒を解かず、捕獲を続ける決意を固めた。夜が更ける頃に沼に向かえば、あなたもいつかその姿を見られるかもしれない。","kr":"골드 킹스네이크는 사냥의 신이 외형을 바꾼 평범한 물고기였을 뿐, 영지에 해를 끼치지 않는다고 한다. 하지만 그래도 안심하지 못한 크러시와 솔리드해머는 계속해서 골드 킹스네이크를 잡겠다고 했다. 어쩌면 밤의 늪가에서 그 모습을 찾아볼 수 있을지도 모른다."},"context_summary_status":{"cn":"aligned_plot_summary","en":"aligned_plot_summary","jp":"aligned_plot_summary","kr":"aligned_plot_summary"},"context_summary_record_index":25535,"context_summary_record_indices":[25535],"context_summary_match_status":"aligned_exact_unique","context_summary_source_asset_key":"ep5/npcpanel_menu_10014100","context_summary_direction":"next_plot_summary","context_summary_distance":18,"episode_title_source_cn":"血月将至","episode_title_i18n":{"cn":"血月将至","en":"Thorns of Devotion","jp":"紅き月の刻","kr":"붉은 달의 예언"},"episode_title_status":{"cn":"exact_unique","en":"exact_unique","jp":"exact_unique","kr":"exact_unique"},"episode_title_evidence":{"source":"Config/Season.luae","table_key":"105","season_type":"105","entry_condition":"ed.ConditionX.IsUserInEp(\"Ep05\")","opening_quest":"15010101","episode":"ep5","status":"explicit_episode_and_opening_quest